    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T02:18:01Z",
    "body": "I just checked in Firefox and that is actually what they do. I don't think it's a good option though, because I don't expect a download link to take me anywhere; I expect it to start a file download. I think a better option would be to just display a message saying the file could not be found.\n",
