    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T03:27:31Z",
    "body": "This is covered by https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#downloading-hyperlinks. I don't think there's a specification bug here, so I'll close this since it appears to just be asking for help reading the spec. But happy to reopen if there's an issue being reported that I missed.\n",
