    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T14:59:42Z",
    "body": "Okay, it solve the original issue.\n\nBut IMO, the download attribute spec ( https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#attr-hyperlink-download ) is missing a link to the downloading hyperlinks section ( https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#downloading-hyperlinks ). I suggest to add such link\n",
